ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 35375, Mar. 11, 2025>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation; provided, the amended provisions of Article 23 shall enter into force on July 1, 2025.
Article 2 (Applicability to subject matters of summary mediation proceedings)
The amended provisions of Article 15-2(3) shall begin to apply to cases for which a request for medical dispute mediation is filed with the Mediation and Arbitration Agency after this Decree enters into force.
Article 3 (Applicability to standards for payment of compensation)
The amended provisions of Article 23 shall begin to apply to cases where the Compensation Deliberation Committee determines to pay compensation after the enforcement date under the proviso of Article 1 of the Addenda.
Article 4 (Applicability to documents to be submitted for claims for advances)
The amended provisions of Article 26 shall begin to apply where a claim for an advance for damages is filed with the Mediation and Arbitration Agency after this Decree enters into force.
Article 5 (Transitional measures regarding changes to the nominating and commissioning authority of the chairperson and members of the Compensation Deliberation Committee)
The chairperson and members of the Compensation Deliberation Committee appointed or commissioned by the president pursuant to the previous provisions before this Decree enters into force shall be deemed to have been appointed or commissioned by the Minister of Health and Welfare pursuant to the amended provisions of Article 18(2) and paragraph (3)2 of that Article. In such cases, their term of office shall be the remaining period of his or her previous term of office.

